    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jonathan Levitt",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111765294812554644950/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW2Jm82fqseJdqmMrkDf9SLSWU5iAA2djYkFl14VPkKHGAdvInYMw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Rude staff. Will never go back. Family has been doing business there for years but not anymore. Will find another who treats customers with respect.\nUPDATE SINCE OWNER REPLIED:\nAnd no…I am not interesting in getting in touch with you to explain the situation. As a result of the way I was treated I never want to speak to anyone from your company ever again. If you were the last glasses store in the world..I’d gladly go blind.",
        "time": 1768249258,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carole Perron",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109689044656371255663/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIKlxI3SKLWxk86oAKsajkMtqmQEXMdjN6H25ZR2tHe0W33WA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I bought 2 expensive pairs of glasses, asking explicitly for a style that was robust and wouldnt break, but they broke 1 month past the 1 year warranty period. Newlook is charging full price to repair them. I think Costco has better glasses at half the price. Thanks Newlook, but we wont be shopping there anymore.",
        "time": 1756644903,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Slimon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104048119367404616498/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJICKq8b0AyhgjIsrtZbmh3K3i12DINmS3DKaBO4pEzioQFYQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I had good friendly service and didn’t wait a long time when needing help. I was recommended options for my new glasses that I then had removed 3 days after getting them because it was horrible. I wasn’t properly informed before getting these options like a blue tint that made my tv screen seemed doubled and mixed with my prescription made adapting to them even more difficult causing dizzyness and headaches. When asking them to be removed and giving the reason why, it was then and there did they say “yeah that could happen”. So I asked myself, well why wasn’t I informed before hand. Another 10 days goes by and I get my glasses again without any options to have such horrible vision issues headaches and dizzyness being told the right prescription was in but it felt sooooo off. My old glasses were better and putting them back on made it all go away. So I returned them only having worn them 5 days out of 25 explaining this all and was offered to retake my exam. But my confidence was shattered due to what seemed to be the lack in knowledge of the offered options and the outcome they can give. I got my refund but was told that it could be time consuming to go somewhere else. That’s for me to decide and not for them if it’s time consuming or not. My first and last experience with new look because the whole experience was a waste of time. But the staff are friendly!",
        "time": 1742426643,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julia Schroeder",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103311592464699837136/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJh3WA7zXTwU-BTuLhst7AavtxjwEm-15XLY6Aed962RGlDPg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Dishonest!\n\nMy son went EXPLICITLY for contact lenses, and even transparently mentioned he’d probably be ordering them online (in order to save money). He had his eye test (130$) assumed his prescription would be correct. … left (sent it in online) only to discover that the script is for glasses.\n\nHe called back to correct the problem- asking for the right required information- the man who answered the phone today was incredibly arrogant and blankly stated they don’t even write prescriptions for contact lenses???????? What???? Why did they take his money up front then?????\n\nThis is not yet resolved.\n\nPity for this front of house incompetence since the optician was apparently very pleasant. Our family of 4 (all wearing glasses and contacts) will stay away given this level of dishonesty. Buyer beware!!",
        "time": 1739290285,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Roxanne Gallery",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115614806890063938631/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXZ8u2lbqBUltbpDYUsRF_ayNUATY6bryg0r21gMUx82mSudNs9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Made an eye exam appointment and was pleasantly surprised. From the first greeting, I felt welcome and heard. Thank you!",
        "time": 1757451727,
        "translated": false
      }
